{"id": "DctX3CCPLtd", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"CLAUDE\" to get this Free AI Scraper. \n\nThis free AI tool lets you scrape anything off the internet, without paying for anything.\n\nIt's called ScrapeGraphAI.\n\nIt's an open source Python library with over 30,000 stars on GitHub.\n\nYou give it a website link and describe what you want in plain English.\n\nThen a minute later, it comes back with a clean list of everything you asked for.\n\nSo with this, you can find leads from LinkedIn.\n\nYou can track your competitors and their ads.\n\nOr just do simple research whenever you need it.\n\nThink of it like sending an assistant to read a website for you and hand back exactly the notes you wanted.\n\nNo scrolling, no copy pasting, no manually digging through pages yourself.\n\nPlus it's free, open source, and works with Claude Code and all the leading AI coding agents.\n\n#scrapegraph #Claudecode #githubrepo #webscraping #aiscrap", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1788188946, "like_count": 5776, "comment_count": 4650, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1584007736435292a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 64.767, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMx8vc8qKDaKGfX1IVCEN4357DUIsCNH8iTHUYXjTzT-MNZcKGMXssGUh3brA2_Ra1soJPeJeXEkEV8QmuGf3lkiBxYQdAtHwFDlgw.mp4?_nc_cat=111&_nc_oc=Adq2SmRk_woG_UHVdJyqXn0GGiYgUVhCwPHv5IsumeRcMnfnOVYi9NlcFrnMZwcLq7o&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=DeulYXLUuKYQ7kNvwHoJEOc&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=f5X5nHk5pGgMueWfeCEXcQ&_nc_ss=70a8c&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQSR31nk1L8vJ6mQh0Z-uDOVXdRmmIhVibGFe6cLx5gAxA&oe=6AE60A80", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", 